## What the remaining 29 undefined symbols are

Every one is a CONFIG-gated provider (or 9810-only code) whose caller is built. The tree has **no
compile errors left**. Full table with per-symbol notes in [`4.9port.md`](4.9port.md) §1.

| group | count | examples |
|---|---|---|
| camera DCP / subdev / TDNR / CSI-dump / sensor-I2C | 11 | `fimc_is_subdev_dcp_ops`, `csi_hw_phy_dump` |
| haptic | 4 | `sec_haptic_register`, `haptic_homekey_press` |
| 9810-only CAL + globals | 4 | `cal_pll_mmc_check`, `exynos_pcie_phy_init`, `bootmode`, `pn_flag` |
| MUIC / AFC | 2 | `muic_afc_set_voltage`, `max77865_hv_muic_charger_init` |
| display panel | 1 | `get_lcd_info` |
| cal-if CPU inform, ACPM, regulator, SEC debug, ION | 7 | `pmucal_cpuinform_list`, `exynos_acpm_set_flag`, `s2m_ldo_set_mode` |

## Resolved this session

- `iovmm_map_oto` / `iovmm_unmap_oto` backported from `xxmustafacooTR` `main@ffd1341ec75864d08`.
- `NOTIFY_EVENT_RESERVE_BOOSTER` and `NOTIFY_EVENT_PD_CONTRACT` restored to `usb_notify.h`, in
  donor order **before** the `NOTIFY_EVENT_VIRTUAL` sentinel (load-bearing: `PHY_EVENT(a)` is
  `a % NOTIFY_EVENT_VIRTUAL`).
- The 9810 vision accelerator (IVA) removed. `CONFIG_IVA` was a phantom no Kconfig stanza defines;
  the real gate was `CONFIG_VISION_SUPPORT`.
- All 121 of the Exynos9810 `FIMC_IS_SENSOR_CFG` call sites translated to the 7885 donor's
  `FIMC_IS_SENSOR_CFG_EXT`. Those call sites passed brace-wrapped `VC_IN`/`VC_OUT` initialisers as
  macro arguments, which C's preprocessor cannot represent — only parentheses protect commas.
- DCP driver/header version skew reconciled to the active v6.20 `dcp_param` (18 diagnostics).
- `CONFIG_CAMERA_CIS_2L3_OBJ` cleared (9810 LC 2L3; stock has no such line).
- `CONFIG_MFD_S2MPS18` / `REGULATOR_S2MPS18` / `RTC_DRV_S2MPS18` cleared. `s2mps18` appears
  **0 times** in the stock DTB and all four overlays; `s2mpu08` appears 33 times per overlay.
- LLVM `objdump`/`objcopy`/`readelf` wrappers for the aarch64 prefixes — `Error 127` from the
  missing `aarch64-linux-objdump` was silently costing objects.

## Still open

1. Resolve the 29 undefined symbols so `vmlinux` links.
2. The DTS is **missing every per-sensor camera node** (CIS modules, EEPROMs, flash GPIO, DW9808).
   Drivers compile and compatibles are correct, but nothing will probe.
3. TEEGRIS wired but disabled; `startup.tazar` recovered out of tree.
4. Stock overlay marks `s2mu106-charger` disabled — needs a decision.

**No green build has ever been produced for this target.**
